{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"center","name":"hospitalTitle"},"content":[{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"orgName","labelSnapshot":"机构名称","value":"","placeholder":"机构名称","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":false}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"患者自动出院/转院风险告知书","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}],"attrs":{"textAlign":"center","name":"formTitle"}},{"type":"horizontalRule","attrs":{"lineColor":"#000000","lineWidth":1}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"患者姓名："},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"patientName","labelSnapshot":"患者姓名","value":"","placeholder":"患者姓名","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":false}},{"type":"text","text":"　　性别："},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"gender","labelSnapshot":"性别","value":"","placeholder":"性别","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":false}},{"type":"text","text":"　　年龄："},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"age","labelSnapshot":"年龄","value":"","placeholder":"年龄","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":false}},{"type":"text","text":"　　科室："},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"deptName","labelSnapshot":"科室","value":"","placeholder":"科室","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":false}},{"type":"text","text":"　　病案号："},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"medicalRecordNo","labelSnapshot":"病案号","value":"","placeholder":"病案号","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":false}}],"attrs":{"name":"riskPatientInfo"}},{"type":"horizontalRule","attrs":{"lineColor":"#000000","lineWidth":1}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"医方告知","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}],"attrs":{"name":"riskSectionTitle"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"根据患者目前的疾病状况，患者应当继续留住我院接受诊疗；但患方现强烈要求出院/转院，特将目前出院/转院可能出现的风险及不良后果告知如下："}],"attrs":{"textAlign":"justify","name":"noticeIntro"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"1.自动出院/转院，致使我院原有的诊疗中断，有可能导致病情反复甚至加重，从而为以后的诊断和治疗增加困难，甚至使原有疾病无法治愈或者使患者丧失最佳治疗时机，也有可能促进或导致患者死亡；"}],"attrs":{"textAlign":"justify","name":"noticeItem"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2.自动出院/转院，有可能出现各种感染或使原有的感染加重、伤口延迟愈合、疼痛等各种症状加重或症状持续时间延长，增加患者的痛苦，甚至可能导致不良后果；"}],"attrs":{"textAlign":"justify","name":"noticeItem"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"3.自动出院/转院，患者有可能会出现某一个或者多个器官功能减退、部分功能甚至全部功能丧失，有可能诱发患者出现出血、休克、其他疾病和症状，产生不良后果甚至死亡；"}],"attrs":{"textAlign":"justify","name":"noticeItem"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"4.自动出院/转院有可能导致部分检查或治疗重复进行，有可能导致诊治费用增加；"}],"attrs":{"textAlign":"justify","name":"noticeItem"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"5.自动出院/转院有可能增加患者其他不可预料的风险及不良后果。"}],"attrs":{"textAlign":"justify","name":"noticeItem"}},{"type":"table","attrs":{"name":"admissionSafetySign"},"content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"name":"noticeSignLeft"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"医护人员签名："},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"recorderName","labelSnapshot":"医护人员签名","value":"","placeholder":"医护人员签名","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":true}},{"type":"text","text":"＿＿＿＿＿＿"}],"attrs":{"name":"noticeSignLeft"}}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"name":"noticeSignRight"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"签字时间："},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"staffSignAt","labelSnapshot":"签字时间","value":"","placeholder":"签字时间","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":true}}],"attrs":{"textAlign":"right","name":"noticeSignRight"}}]}]}]},{"type":"horizontalRule","attrs":{"lineColor":"#000000","lineWidth":1}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"患方明确意见","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}],"attrs":{"name":"riskSectionTitle"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我具有完全民事行为能力，拒绝医院继续提供住院医疗服务，并在违背医护人员意见的情况下离开医院。医护人员已经向我解释了医疗诊治对患者疾病的重要性和必要性，并且将自动出院/转院可能出现的风险及后果向我做了详细、通俗、明确、具体的告知。经慎重考虑"},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"insistLeaveText","labelSnapshot":"我坚持","value":"","placeholder":"我坚持","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":true}},{"type":"text","text":"（手写“我坚持”）离开该医院，并"},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"voluntaryRiskText","labelSnapshot":"自愿承担","value":"","placeholder":"自愿承担","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":true}},{"type":"text","text":"（手写“自愿承担”）自动出院/转院所带来的风险和不良后果。"}],"attrs":{"textAlign":"justify","name":"noticeIntro"}},{"type":"table","attrs":{"name":"admissionSafetySign"},"content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"name":"noticeSignLeft"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"患者签名："},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"familySigner","labelSnapshot":"患者签名","value":"","placeholder":"患者签名","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":true}},{"type":"text","text":"＿＿＿＿＿＿"}],"attrs":{"name":"noticeSignLeft"}}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"name":"noticeSignRight"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"签字时间："},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"signDate","labelSnapshot":"签字时间","value":"","placeholder":"签字时间","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":true}}],"attrs":{"textAlign":"right","name":"noticeSignRight"}}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"或患者的监护人/委托代理人/近亲属签名："},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"guardianSigner","labelSnapshot":"监护人/代理人签名","value":"","placeholder":"监护人/代理人签名","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":true}},{"type":"text","text":"　　与患者的关系："},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"patientRelation","labelSnapshot":"与患者的关系","value":"","placeholder":"与患者的关系","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":true}}],"attrs":{"name":"riskGuardianSign"}}]}
