    $tpl_hormone$
{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"orgName","labelSnapshot":"机构名称","value":"","placeholder":"机构名称","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":false}}],"attrs":{"name":"hospitalTitle","textAlign":"center"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"糖皮质激素使用知情告知书","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}],"attrs":{"name":"formTitle","textAlign":"center"}},{"type":"horizontalRule","attrs":{"lineColor":"#000000","lineWidth":1}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"患者姓名："},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"patientName","labelSnapshot":"患者姓名","value":"","placeholder":"患者姓名","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":false}},{"type":"text","text":"　　性别："},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"gender","labelSnapshot":"性别","value":"","placeholder":"性别","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":false}},{"type":"text","text":"　　年龄："},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"age","labelSnapshot":"年龄","value":"","placeholder":"年龄","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":false}}],"attrs":{"name":"riskPatientInfo"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"住院病区："},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"deptName","labelSnapshot":"住院病区","value":"","placeholder":"住院病区","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":false}},{"type":"text","text":"　　住院号："},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"inpatientNo","labelSnapshot":"住院号","value":"","placeholder":"住院号","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":false}}],"attrs":{"name":"riskPatientInfo"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"临床诊断："},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"primaryDiagnosis","labelSnapshot":"临床诊断","value":"","placeholder":"临床诊断","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":false}}],"attrs":{"name":"riskPatientInfo"}},{"type":"horizontalRule","attrs":{"lineColor":"#000000","lineWidth":1}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"告知内容","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}],"attrs":{"name":"riskSectionTitle"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"一、根据患者病情，需要使用糖皮质激素（请填写药品，如甲强龙/强的松/地塞米松/氢化可的松/其他）："}],"attrs":{"name":"noticeIntro","textAlign":"justify"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"hormoneDrug","labelSnapshot":"糖皮质激素药品","value":"","placeholder":"糖皮质激素药品","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":true}}],"attrs":{"name":"noticeIntro"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"二、使用糖皮质激素可能会出现的不良反应："}],"attrs":{"name":"noticeIntro","textAlign":"justify"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"1、内分泌系统：月经失调、皮肤变薄、皮下淤血，向心性肥胖、多毛、痤疮等。"}],"attrs":{"name":"noticeItem","textAlign":"justify"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2、代谢：出现血糖升高、糖尿病或加重糖尿病，脂代谢异常，低蛋白血症等。"}],"attrs":{"name":"noticeItem","textAlign":"justify"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"3、体液与电解质紊乱：体液潴留、低血钾等。"}],"attrs":{"name":"noticeItem","textAlign":"justify"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"4、免疫系统：可诱发和掩盖各种感染，使体内原有潜在感染病灶扩散、机会感染、过敏反应、抑制皮试反应。"}],"attrs":{"name":"noticeItem","textAlign":"justify"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"5、消化道和心血管系统：有发生加重胃肠病变，延缓溃疡愈合，重者可导致出血或穿孔。引起高血压或加重高血压，冠心病，充血性心力衰竭，各种心律失常等心血管疾病。"}],"attrs":{"name":"noticeItem","textAlign":"justify"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"6、骨骼肌肉和眼睛的影响：导致骨质疏松，严重者可导致骨折或股骨头坏死、肌肉萎缩；可引起角膜溃疡、眼内压增高、可加重青光眼、白内障等眼部疾病。"}],"attrs":{"name":"noticeItem","textAlign":"justify"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"7、神经系统和发育：可兴奋神经系统，引起激动、睡眠障碍或失眠等，导致神经失常或诱发癫痫发作，个性改变及重度抑郁等明显表现。影响儿童生长发育，妊娠期使用影响胎儿或新生儿的生长和发育。"}],"attrs":{"name":"noticeItem","textAlign":"justify"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"8、肾上腺皮质功能不全和反跳现象：可导致肾上腺皮质萎缩和功能不全。长期大剂量用药后，减量过快或突然停药，或停药短时间内遇有应急情况时（如感染、创伤、手术等）可发生肾上腺危象，原有疾病可加重。"}],"attrs":{"name":"noticeItem","textAlign":"justify"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"以上情况由经治医师已向患者及（或）家属作了详细说明，患者及（或）家属对上述情况已经清楚明白并充分理解，"},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"consentChoice","labelSnapshot":"同意/不同意接受","value":"","placeholder":"同意/不同意接受","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":true}},{"type":"text","text":"接受该治疗方案。"}],"attrs":{"name":"noticeIntro","textAlign":"justify"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"患者签名（并按手印）："},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"patientSigner","labelSnapshot":"患者签名","value":"","placeholder":"患者签名","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":true}}],"attrs":{"name":"riskGuardianSign"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"患者家属签名（并按手印）："},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"familySigner","labelSnapshot":"患者家属签名","value":"","placeholder":"患者家属签名","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":true}},{"type":"text","text":"　　与患者关系："},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"patientRelation","labelSnapshot":"与患者关系","value":"","placeholder":"与患者关系","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":true}}],"attrs":{"name":"riskGuardianSign"}},{"type":"table","attrs":{"name":"admissionSafetySign"},"content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"name":"noticeSignLeft"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"经治医师签名："},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"recorderName","labelSnapshot":"经治医师签名","value":"","placeholder":"经治医师签名","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":true}},{"type":"text","text":"＿＿＿＿＿＿"}],"attrs":{"name":"noticeSignLeft"}}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"name":"noticeSignRight"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"日期："},{"type":"emrDataElement","attrs":{"elementId":"signDate","labelSnapshot":"日期","value":"","placeholder":"日期","widgetOverride":"text","optionsJson":"[]","editable":true}}],"attrs":{"name":"noticeSignRight","textAlign":"right"}}]}]}]}]}
